                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                        "login": "echasnovski",
                        "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                        "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Yes, this look like the best solution here. Here is a bit fuller example (because `MiniAi` is usually not present at the stage of defining this data; i.e. before `setup()`):\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal ai = require('mini.ai')\r\nai.setup({\r\n  custom_textobjects = {\r\n    b = {\r\n      {\r\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('【', '】'),\r\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('（', '）'),\r\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('(', ')', { type = 'balanced' }),\r\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('[', ']', { type = 'balanced' }),\r\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('{', '}', { type = 'balanced' }),\r\n      },\r\n    },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs to *why* the solution in the question doesn't work is because the `\"^.().*().$\"` selects only a single-byte first and last character. While used Chinese brackets are multi-byte.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, this look like the best solution here. Here is a bit fuller example (because <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniAi</code> is usually not present at the stage of defining this data; i.e. before <code class=\"notranslate\">setup()</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local ai = require('mini.ai')\nai.setup({\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    b = {\n      {\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('【', '】'),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('（', '）'),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('(', ')', { type = 'balanced' }),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('[', ']', { type = 'balanced' }),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('{', '}', { type = 'balanced' }),\n      },\n    },\n  },\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.ai<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">custom_textobjects</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">b</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n      {\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_spec</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">pair</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>【<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>】<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>),\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_spec</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">pair</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>（<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>）<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>),\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_spec</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">pair</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>(<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>)<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>balanced<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>}),\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_spec</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">pair</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>[<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>]<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>balanced<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>}),\n        <span class=\"pl-smi\">ai</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">gen_spec</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">pair</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>}<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">type</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>balanced<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>}),\n      },\n    },\n  },\n})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As to <em>why</em> the solution in the question doesn't work is because the <code class=\"notranslate\">\"^.().*().$\"</code> selects only a single-byte first and last character. While used Chinese brackets are multi-byte.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Yes, this look like the best solution here. Here is a bit fuller example (because MiniAi is usually not present at the stage of defining this data; i.e. before setup()):\nlocal ai = require('mini.ai')\nai.setup({\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    b = {\n      {\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('【', '】'),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('（', '）'),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('(', ')', { type = 'balanced' }),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('[', ']', { type = 'balanced' }),\n        ai.gen_spec.pair('{', '}', { type = 'balanced' }),\n      },\n    },\n  },\n})\nAs to why the solution in the question doesn't work is because the \"^.().*().$\" selects only a single-byte first and last character. While used Chinese brackets are multi-byte.",
